{"id":"52d4873132cdcfe2","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-l-in-fo-lfp.md","title":"有序有限结构上 L 包含于 FO(LFP)","display":"thm-l-in-fo-lfp — 有序有限结构上 L 包含于 FO(LFP)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-l-in-fo-lfp","aliases":["29-thm-l-in-fo-lfp"],"display":"thm-l-in-fo-lfp — 有序有限结构上 L 包含于 FO(LFP)","depends_on":["[[29-thm-lfp-ptime]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]"],"source_locator":"§2.2; Theorem 4.10, pp.26,60, DjVu scans 41,75","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-l-in-fo-lfp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-l-in-fo-lfp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-l-in-fo-lfp — 有序有限结构上 L 包含于 FO(LFP)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9c44b3d89fc5839f\" href=\"?note=9c44b3d89fc5839f\" title=\"29-thm-lfp-ptime\">29-thm-lfp-ptime</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§2.2; Theorem 4.10, pp.26,60, DjVu scans 41,75"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\notin\\tau\">\\(&lt;\\notin\\tau\\)</span>；查询限制到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm L^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm L^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>。</li>\n<li>Immerman–Vardi 等式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9c44b3d89fc5839f\" href=\"?note=9c44b3d89fc5839f\" title=\"29-thm-lfp-ptime\">29-thm-lfp-ptime</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm L^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm L^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定机器的对数空间配置数为多项式；停机确定性计算可在多项式时间内模拟。因此第一项包含成立，后一个等式取原书 Theorem 4.10。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-thm-lfp-ptime","status":"resolved","id":"9c44b3d89fc5839f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-lfp-ptime]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数